    "assumptions": [
      "Short-term SMA period is short_len = 200 and long-term SMA period is long_len = 300.",
      "Oversold level is rsi_us = 35; rsi_ov = 65 is an unused overbought level.",
      "RSI length is not stated and is not listed among parameters to tweak, so RSI(14) is assumed as the usual default and kept fixed.",
      "SMAs are calculated on close price.",
      "Previous RSI below current RSI is encoded as RSI[1] < RSI[0].",
      "Bullish trade is interpreted as direction long.",
      "Daily values of BTCUSD is interpreted as BTCUSDT on 1d timeframe.",
      "holding_period is interpreted as time-based liquidation only: max_hold_bars = 20 with no other exit condition.",
      "initial_capital = 100000 does not affect entry/exit rules and is ignored."
